---
/** 系譜を箱の列で。変わる部分（共通の接頭・接尾を除いた部分）を青で。sep は段階順でない並び（／）に使う */
import type { ChainLine } from '../lib/dict';
interface Props { lines: ChainLine[]; sep?: string; class?: string; lang?: string }
const { lines, sep = '→', class: cls, lang } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['chain-lines', cls]} lang={lang}>
  {lines.map((ln) => (
    <div class="chain-line">
      {ln.showLabel && <span class="lbl chain-lbl">{ln.label}</span>}
      {ln.items.map((it, i) => (
        <>
          {i > 0 && <span class="chain-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{sep}</span>}
          <a class:list={['chain-item min', { 'is-cur': it.cur }]} href={it.href} aria-current={it.cur ? 'page' : undefined} hreflang={lang ? 'ja' : undefined}>
            {it.a}<span class:list={{ hl: it.hl }}>{it.b}</span>{it.c}
          </a>
        </>
      ))}
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
